cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "RPG Web Foundation"
abstract: >-
  Server-authoritative foundation for a grid-based (tile and turn) browser RPG
  themed on Solo Leveling. TypeScript monorepo with a NestJS and Socket.IO
  server, a Phaser and Vite client, and shared Zod contracts. The server
  validates movement, combat, progression and rewards; the client only renders.
authors:
  - family-names: Albarello
    given-names: Willian
repository-code: "https://github.com/walbarellos/sololeveling-rpg"
date-released: "2026-10-12"
keywords:
